 "name_en": "Engineering Bill of Material – Versions Management (1NR)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Engineering Bill of Material – Versions Management (1NR)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio21c89aa096ee47599148e2de1ce9c261\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio21c89aa096ee47599148e2de1ce9c261__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">An engineering bill of material (EBOM) is a type of bill of material (BOM) that reflects the product as designed by engineering, referred to as the as-designed bill of material. The lifecycle of the EBOM is covered via a new versioning technology. By setting a released status at the header level, the EBOM is ready for handover to manufacturing. After releasing a BOM version, no further changes are allowed. A new version must be created. All process steps are carried out by the BOM engineer. The process distinguishes between major BOM changes where it is copied or created and minor changes where the BOM is being changed.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio21c89aa096ee47599148e2de1ce9c261__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create new versioned BOM</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create BOM</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Release version</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform form fit function change – Negative case</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create new version of BOM</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Release version</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform form fit function change – Positive case</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Copy (Create) Header Material</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Copy (Create) versioned BOM</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Discard versioned BOM</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Change versioned BOM</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Release version</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio21c89aa096ee47599148e2de1ce9c261__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Support EBOM creation and change process</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage lifecycle of EBOM easily by using new release and versioning technology</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate documents intuitively on text item level with Document Attachment Service</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Support the stock item and text item categories</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>工程物料清单 - 版本管理 (1NR)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio21c89aa096ee47599148e2de1ce9c261\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio21c89aa096ee47599148e2de1ce9c261__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">工程物料清单 (EBOM) 是一种物料清单 (BOM)，反映由工程设计的产品，称为按设计的物料清单。通过新的版本化技术涵盖 EBOM 的生命周期。通过在抬头级别设置已发布状态，EBOM 已准备好移交至制造。发布物料清单版本后，不允许进一步更改。必须创建新版本。所有流程步骤均由物料清单工程师执行。该流程区分复制或创建的主要物料清单更改，以及正在更改物料清单的细微更改。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio21c89aa096ee47599148e2de1ce9c261__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建新的版本化物料清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建物料清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">发布版本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行完全互换变更 - 反向案例</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建新版本的物料清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">发布版本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行完全互换变更 - 正向案例</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">复制（创建）抬头物料</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">复制（创建）版本化物料清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">放弃版本化物料清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">更改版本化物料清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">发布版本</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio21c89aa096ee47599148e2de1ce9c261__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">支持工程物料清单创建和更改流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用新版本和版本化技术轻松管理 EBOM 的生命周期</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在文本项目级别将凭证与凭证附件服务直观集成。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">支持库存项目和文本项目类别</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
